---
import './research-figures.css';
---
<figure class="rf rf-adaptive" data-research-figure="adaptive-questioning" data-product-demo="adaptive-decision">
  <div class="rf__canvas">
    <div class="rf-adaptive__flow">
      <div class="rf-adaptive__question">Should we acquire Northstar?</div>
      <div class="rf-adaptive__stem" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="rf-adaptive__question rf-adaptive__question--focus">What must this acquisition achieve that organic growth cannot?</div>
      <div class="rf-adaptive__stem" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="rf-adaptive__branches">
        <div class="rf-adaptive__branch">
          <span>Established mandate</span>
          <strong>Close a 24-month market-entry gap.</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="rf-adaptive__branch rf-adaptive__branch--signal">
          <span>Load-bearing assumption</span>
          <strong>Organic entry cannot reach the target in time.</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rf-adaptive__next">
        <span>GreenSquare asks next</span>
        <strong>What evidence supports the 24-month timing constraint?</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span class="rf__fig-number">Figure 02</span>
    <span>The next question follows the state of the decision. An answer changes what must be established next rather than advancing through a fixed questionnaire.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
